---
import Signature from './Signature.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="section section--alt">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <div class="about__portrait">
      {/* A studio shot of her actually working would outperform this eventually —
          buyers connect with the maker mid-process. Good enough to launch on. */}
      <img
        src="/images/jennifer-mazer-headshot.jpg"
        alt="Jennifer Mazer, artist and party designer, smiling outdoors on a sunny day"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        width="768"
        height="1024"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="about__copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About the Artist</p>
      <h2>Jennifer Mazer</h2>

      {/* TODO — replace with Jennifer's real bio, in her own voice.
          200–300 words. Where she's from, how she started painting, what she's
          drawn to, and how the party work grew out of the art. This is the
          second-most-read section on any artist site after the gallery. */}
      <p>
        Jennifer paints citrus against deep navy — lemons and oranges built up
        in layers until the fruit holds its own light, orange blossoms worked
        petal by petal so no two are quite alike. Alongside them are koi turning
        through blue water and a pumpkin ringed in sunflowers. Different
        subjects, same hand.
      </p>
      <p>
        The same eye runs through everything else she makes. A hand-lettered
        banner for a baby shower. Unicorn cookies iced one at a time. Cannoli
        and cream puffs for a table she also styled. She has never been able to
        design just one part of something.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every piece and every party is made by hand, one at a time, for the
        person who asked for it.
      </p>

      <Signature height="3.25rem" color="var(--navy)" class="about__sig" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about__portrait {
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    background: var(--cream-deep);
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
  }

  .about__portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .about__sig {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .about__sig { color: var(--lemon) !important; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about__portrait { max-width: 420px; }
  }
</style>
